### Step 2: Calculate the frequency of the electromagnetic wave.

The relationship between the speed of light (c), wavelength (\(\lambda\)), and frequency (\(\nu\)) is given by \(c = \nu \lambda\). Therefore, frequency \(\nu = \frac{c}{\lambda}\).
